1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,280
Every single night, the lonely young boy desperately wished he could stop time.

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:11,879
Then, by some impossible miracle, his silent wish finally came true one ordinary afternoon.

3
00:00:11,879 --> 00:00:17,783
He could suddenly freeze everything around him, including the pouring rain and frozen wind.

4
00:00:17,783 --> 00:00:23,975
At first, wielding this extraordinary and absolute power made him feel like an invincible god.

5
00:00:23,975 --> 00:00:30,024
He cruelly used his incredible gift to win fights and effortlessly escape every painful problem.

6
00:00:30,024 --> 00:00:36,335
But slowly and painfully, he began to notice a deeply terrifying and irreversible cost.

7
00:00:36,335 --> 00:00:42,287
Every time he stopped time, someone he deeply loved mysteriously forgot a memory of him.

8
00:00:42,287 --> 00:00:48,431
Desperate to fix his tragic mistakes, he stopped time one final time and whispered softly.

9
00:00:48,431 --> 00:00:52,679
I do not need a world that stops for me, I just want you.

10
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:58,247
He let time flow again, choosing to bravely grow older instead of living forever.
